      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Acknowledges skepticism and the ease of generating false claims, which is good. The decentralized witness network introduces complexity and potential governance challenges. The focus on privacy is a key risk area."
    },
    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Very clear and concise. The problem (shallow depth of field in macro photography) and the solution (automated focus stacking) are immediately understandable.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Clearly targets a specific, passionate niche market (macro photographers). The use cases are well-defined and relatable.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• The prototype demonstrates functional proof of concept. The staged development plan (SDK, calibration, controller separation) is reasonable. The open design and SDK are strong advantages.",
