      "Differentiation": "• Differentiation is primarily based on ease of use and automation, which is a solid selling point. The open design and SDK are key differentiators.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Demonstrated through sample images and animations. The open design encourages community contribution and further showcases the product’s capabilities.",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Low technical risk due to the existing prototype. The primary challenge is scaling manufacturing, which is a common risk. The team’s experience mitigates this risk."
    }
  },
  "winner": "B"
}
